# Scope Fallback & Protection

- **Workspace Root:** Confined to consumer workspace. Do not touch parent or external sibling repositories.
- **Protected Paths:** Gated paths (rules, hooks, policy, SDLC baselines) require explicit stamp or user request to alter.
- **Small Diffs:** Prefer minimal, surgical edits matching existing repo style over sweeping refactors.
- **Test Before Closure:** Verify local changes with controlled test commands before completing turn.
